{"id":578,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"感恩奉仕を軸に育む女子の中高一貫教育","feature_description":"西南女学院は、キリスト教に基づく女子教育を行い、建学の精神「感恩奉仕」を教育の中心に据えます。中高一貫の6年間で、感謝の心を育て、他者や社会のために行動する姿勢を大切にします。統合学力教育、グローバル教育、キリスト教教育を組み合わせ、英語で伝える力や探究活動にも取り組みます。学びと生活を通じて、優れた教養・知識・技能と、他者を尊重し社会に貢献する人格を育む学校です。","clubs":[{"id":10777,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10778,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10779,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10780,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10781,"name":"化学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10782,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10783,"name":"ハンドベル部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10959,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10960,"name":"華道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10961,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10962,"name":"生物部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10963,"name":"新聞部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10964,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seinan-jogakuin.jp/shioncourse","verified_at":"202